            "Return the final public reply to UserSim."
          ],
          "accent": false
        },
        {
          "x": 70,
          "y": 770,
          "w": 1360,
          "h": 140,
          "title": "4. Finalize And Inspect",
          "lines": [
            "Continue up to three conversation turns; preserve partial outputs, failures and native warnings.",
